  <head>
    <component name='Geospatial' level='1'/>
    <meta name='title' content='geolod-origin'/>
    <meta name='description' content='Repro for a spec question: the X3D 4.0 XSD content model for GeoLOD is an optional sequence (rootNode children, GeoOrigin, rootNode children), so a GeoLOD that holds any rootNode child inline must also hold a GeoOrigin. The X3D 4.0 specification makes geoOrigin optional and discourages GeoOrigin. This file has a GeoLOD whose rootNode holds a GeoLocation with a small gold obelisk at the Virginia Tech campus (37.2284 N, 80.4234 W, 630 m), and no GeoOrigin.'/>
    <meta name='creator' content='HagopJay'/>
    <meta name='generator' content='hand-written Python generator, X3D research showcase'/>
  </head>
